WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.717
Choose Road in the Design panel to draw

2
00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:03.994
a new street.

3
00:00:04.344 --> 00:00:08.013
Edit the cross-section. Choose a preset, then adjust

4
00:00:08.082 --> 00:00:11.264
lanes for traffic, cycling and walking.

5
00:00:11.614 --> 00:00:14.470
Use a standard profile as the starting point,

6
00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:16.537
then apply it to the drawing.

7
00:00:16.914 --> 00:00:20.118
Draw the route with clicks, then choose Finish.

8
00:00:20.481 --> 00:00:24.463
Review conflicts with existing buildings. Choose a surface

9
00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.447
road, a tunnel, or another route.

10
00:00:27.797 --> 00:00:31.547
Inspect the road in 3D. Tilt, rotate and

11
00:00:31.628 --> 00:00:35.367
zoom to review its cross-section and connections.
